# Long River's Pull {U}{U}: "Gift a card. Counter target creature spell. If the gift was promised, instead counter target spell."
# With the gift promised the Pull counters any spell: Bot2's Lightning Bolt aimed at Bot1 is countered (Bot1 stays at 20) and Bot2,
# the opponent promised the gift, draws a card (8 after the turn's draw, less Mountain and Bolt, plus one: 7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Long River's Pull
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Long River's Pull.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Long River's Pull
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
